# Peer collaboration

Read `coordination/terra_restart/START_HERE.md` and `PROTOCOL.md` for this workflow.
Claude and Codex are peers; neither controls the other. The user authorizes phases and substantive scope changes.
Propose alternatives with evidence; retain independent reports; resolve material disagreements with the user.
Mailbox messages do not automatically wake an agent, and a peer PASS does not authorize execution.
Do not start the manuscript restart from a template, proposal or historical approval.
Preserve protected sources, data and results. Use the 39-page archive, not the 23-page compression draft, as the authorized reconstruction source.
Verify meaning and rendered evidence as well as source/build integrity.
